	go func() {
		defer s.backgroundRunnerWG.Done()
		s3presignRunner.Run(s3Context)
		slog.Info("s3presign runner stopped")
	}()
```

That function is invoked from `Server.Start` at `server/server.go:129`, right after the HTTP listener goroutine starts, and is torn down by `stopBackgroundRunners`/`waitBackgroundRunners` during `Server.Shutdown`.

